Subject: [PATCH 011/110] =?UTF-8?q?fix(rig):=20make=20gt=20rig=20add=20ato?=
 =?UTF-8?q?mic=20=E2=80=94=20save=20rigs.json=20inside=20AddRig=20before?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20cleanup=20defer=20exits=20(#3543)?=
